17:["$","ul",null,{"style":{"paddingLeft":24,"margin":"0 0 1em"},"children":[["$","li","A utility bill issued within the last 3 (three) months",{"style":"$f:props:children:0:props:style","children":"A utility bill issued within the last 3 (three) months"}],["$","li","A bank confirmation letter dated not more than 3 (three) months ago",{"style":"$f:props:children:0:props:style","children":"A bank confirmation letter dated not more than 3 (three) months ago"}],["$","li","A bank statement (letter form) no older than 3 (three) months",{"style":"$f:props:children:0:props:style","children":"A bank statement (letter form) no older than 3 (three) months"}],["$","li","Evidence of the source of funds or wealth (e.g., payslips, property sale contracts, loan agreements, inheritance documents)",{"style":"$f:props:children:0:props:style","children":"Evidence of the source of funds or wealth (e.g., payslips, property sale contracts, loan agreements, inheritance documents)"}],["$","li","A secondary ID (for example, a valid driving license)",{"style":"$f:props:children:0:props:style","children":"A secondary ID (for example, a valid driving license)"}],["$","li","Notarized copies of any of the above",{"style":"$f:props:children:0:props:style","children":"Notarized copies of any of the above"}]]}]
18:["$","p","3.1",{"style":"$7:props:children:0:1:props:children:props:children:4:props:style","children":[["$","strong",null,{"style":{"color":"#f4f4f6"},"children":"3.1"}]," ",["The Client sends all requested documents as JPG, JPEG or PDF attachments via email to our Compliance Department at ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:verification@stockity.com","style":{"color":"#0c8df8","textDecoration":"none"},"children":"verification@stockity.com"}],". We cannot accept RAR/ZIP archives or DOC/DOCX files. All materials must be delivered within fourteen (14) calendar days of our request. Upon receipt of a complete document set, verification is normally completed within twenty (20) minutes. In certain circumstances, this timeframe may be extended up to seven (7) calendar days."]]}]
